# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  AI Data Engineering Suite — environment configuration
#
#  1. Copy this file to ".env"  (same folder as app.py)
#  2. Paste your OpenRouter API key below
#  3. Run:  streamlit run app.py
#
#  The key is read from .env or .streamlit/secrets.toml ONLY.
#  It is never hardcoded in the source. If no key is set, the app
#  still runs — AI features simply show a "add your key" message.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-your-key-here

# Get a free key at: https://openrouter.ai/keys
# Default free models used by the app:
#   chat : nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-omni-30b-a3b-reasoning:free
#   chat : openai/gpt-oss-120b:free
#   embed: nvidia/llama-nemotron-embed-vl-1b-v2:free
